      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "51:40-53:10", "frame_file": "01.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 3100, "original_excerpt": "a bad relationship with your digital tools", "text": "数字卫生差，意味着你和数字工具关系失调"},
        {"source_time": 3100, "original_excerpt": "specifically your notifications", "text": "其中最常见的问题就是通知"},
        {"source_time": 3100, "original_excerpt": "You sit down to focus", "text": "当你坐下来专注工作"},
        {"source_time": 3100, "original_excerpt": "Where is your phone", "text": "先问问你的手机放在哪里"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2, "total": 8, "subtitle": "实验只改变手机的位置",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "53:41-55:08", "frame_file": "02.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 3221, "original_excerpt": "turn your phone completely off", "text": "先把手机彻底关机"},
        {"source_time": 3221, "original_excerpt": "in another room", "text": "第一种情况，手机放在另一个房间"},
        {"source_time": 3261, "original_excerpt": "in your pocket or a bag", "text": "第二种情况，手机放进口袋或包里"},
        {"source_time": 3284, "original_excerpt": "put your phone face down", "text": "第三种情况，手机反扣在桌上"},
        {"source_time": 3284, "original_excerpt": "doing all of these assessments", "text": "然后完成同样的一组测试"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 3, "total": 8, "subtitle": "看见手机，成绩就下降",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "55:30-56:20", "frame_file": "03.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 3308, "original_excerpt": "the phone is dead", "text": "三种情况里，手机都处于关机状态"},
        {"source_time": 3308, "original_excerpt": "You're not using it", "text": "参与者也都没有使用手机"},
        {"source_time": 3336, "original_excerpt": "the phone was visible", "text": "但当手机出现在视野中"},
        {"source_time": 3336, "original_excerpt": "scores were significantly decreased", "text": "各项测试得分都显著下降"},
        {"source_time": 3336, "original_excerpt": "attention ... general fluid intelligence", "text": "注意力和一般流体智力都受到了影响"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 4, "total": 8, "subtitle": "大脑知道手机里有什么",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "56:08-57:29", "frame_file": "04.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 3410, "original_excerpt": "Everything is in the phone. Memories", "text": "手机里装着你的许多记忆"},
        {"source_time": 3368, "original_excerpt": "friends, making plans, good news, bad news", "text": "朋友、计划、好消息和坏消息都在里面"},
        {"source_time": 3410, "original_excerpt": "Your brain knows that", "text": "你的大脑知道这一切"},
        {"source_time": 3410, "original_excerpt": "if you can see it", "text": "所以只要看见手机，大脑就会想到那些内容"},
        {"source_time": 3410, "original_excerpt": "hide your phone ... out of sight", "text": "把手机藏起来，让它离开视线"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 5, "total": 8, "subtitle": "多任务并不是同时处理",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "67:40-71:50", "frame_file": "05.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 4060, "original_excerpt": "doing two different things ... same time", "text": "人们以为多任务是同时做两件事"},
        {"source_time": 4097, "original_excerpt": "How many brains do you have? One", "text": "但你只有一个大脑"},
        {"source_time": 4097, "original_excerpt": "how many attention systems", "text": "也只有一套注意系统"},
        {"source_time": 4097, "original_excerpt": "You don't have two 100s", "text": "你没有两个完整的百分之百"},
        {"source_time": 4129, "original_excerpt": "you're splitting your attention", "text": "无论怎么分配，注意力都被拆开了"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 6, "total": 8, "subtitle": "真正发生的是任务切换",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "71:38-72:40", "frame_file": "06.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 4298, "original_excerpt": "something called task switching", "text": "真正发生的事情叫作任务切换"},
        {"source_time": 4298, "original_excerpt": "from A to B, B to C", "text": "注意力从A切到B，再从B切到C"},
        {"source_time": 4298, "original_excerpt": "a biological payment", "text": "每一次切换都有生理代价"},
        {"source_time": 4334, "original_excerpt": "pays for it in time", "text": "大脑会用时间支付"},
        {"source_time": 4334, "original_excerpt": "the second thing ... is energy", "text": "还会用精力支付"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 7, "total": 8, "subtitle": "切换让时间翻了一倍",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "65:15-67:40", "frame_file": "07.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 3926, "original_excerpt": "17.72", "text": "第一次完成任务用了十七点七二秒"},
        {"source_time": 3982, "original_excerpt": "you have to still alternate", "text": "第二次必须在两项任务间来回交替"},
        {"source_time": 4030, "original_excerpt": "41.35", "text": "最后用时变成四十一点三五秒"},
        {"source_time": 4030, "original_excerpt": "More than double", "text": "时间增加到了两倍以上"},
        {"source_time": 4030, "original_excerpt": "A lot", "text": "而且过程中还犯了很多错误"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 8, "total": 8, "subtitle": "重要工作要移走干扰",
      "frame_time": null, "frame_target_range": "72:14-77:20", "frame_file": "08.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 4334, "original_excerpt": "when you're doing something hard", "text": "当你在做真正困难的事情"},
        {"source_time": 4334, "original_excerpt": "distractions out of sight", "text": "请让所有干扰离开视线"},
